```pseudocode
FUNCTION login(username: STRING, password: STRING) RETURNS BOOLEAN
    IF NOT EXISTS USERS_FILE
        RETURN FALSE
    ENDIF
    OPEN USERS_FILE FOR READING
    FOR EACH line IN file
        SPLIT line INTO stored_username AND stored_password
        IF stored_username EQUALS username AND stored_password EQUALS password
            SET self.username TO username
            SET self.password TO password
            RETURN TRUE
        ENDIF
    ENDFOR
    RETURN FALSE
END FUNCTION
```

Key Functionality:
- The `login` function checks if the provided username and password match any stored credentials, returning true if a match is found.

