## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:book_search

```pseudocode
FUNCTION search_books(query: STRING) RETURNS LIST OF Book
    SET query_lower TO LOWERCASE(query)
    SET results TO EMPTY LIST
    FOR EACH book IN books
        IF query_lower IN book.title.lower() OR query_lower IN book.author.lower() OR query_lower IN book.summary.lower() OR query_lower IN book.description.lower()
            APPEND book TO results
        ENDIF
    ENDFOR
    RETURN results
END FUNCTION
```

Key Functionality:
- The `search_books` function searches through the list of books for matches based on the title, author, summary, or description, returning a list of matching books.

---

```
CLASS BookManager
    FUNCTION search_books(query)
        query_lower = lowercase(query)
        books = load all books from BOOKS_FILE (each line JSON decoded)
        results = empty list
        FOR each book in books
            IF query_lower in book.title.lower() OR
               query_lower in book.author.lower() OR
               query_lower in book.summary.lower()
                ADD book to results
            ENDIF
        ENDFOR
        RETURN results
    END

    FUNCTION _load_books()
        IF BOOKS_FILE does not exist
            RETURN empty list
        ENDIF
        OPEN BOOKS_FILE for reading
        FOR each line in file
            TRY parse JSON line as book
            ADD book to books list
            EXCEPT JSON error: skip line
        ENDFOR
        RETURN books list
    END
ENDCLASS

