Improvement Guidance1:  
Implement a mechanism to confirm the Flask app is fully initialized and ready to serve requests before accepting connections. Consider adding startup synchronization or health check endpoints that can be polled before tests or clients interact with the app. This avoids race conditions where the app is not ready but requests are made.

